@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:30020

### Append once subscriptions have been created
POST {{baseUrl}}/publish-stream/orders/compute
Content-Type: application/json

{"iterations":1}

### Passive catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/data/streams?prefix=ord&limit=100

### Retained history; does not execute functions
GET {{baseUrl}}/data/streams/orders/messages?limit=100

### Independent progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/data/streams/orders/functions
